    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5f0021f3-2b2e-597e-8d9f-b3c8d8dcedcd" activityNameId="6e57b2c6-79a1-5c6a-9946-4327c36e18f8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, bagasse, sugarcane, at fermentation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, bagasse, sugarcane, at fermentation plant
The multioutput-process "sugar cane, to fermentation" delivers the co-products Ethanol, 95% in H20, from sugar cane" and "electricity, bagasse, at fermentation plant".  The allocation is based on  economic criteria.;
UUID: 23bd1893-5632-364e-9dbe-06f91fb128bb
Fermentation of sugar cane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure, and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Brazil.
Technology: Production of ethanol from sugar cane with extraction, fermentation, and distillation of ethanol. Capacity of the plant:  90000 t/a.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: Total production of ethanol from cane in Brazil  is around 16.6 Mio m3 per a.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_23bd1893-5632-364e-9dbe-06f91fb128bb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="af2fe869-d899-51ee-a481-925418bd269e" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
